[01:36.00] Did you stand there all alone?
[01:39.43] Oh, I cannot explain what's going down
[01:44.60] I can see you standing next to me
[01:47.42] In and out somewhere else right now
[01:53.33] You sigh, look away
[01:58.64] I can see it clear as day
[02:02.34] Close your eyes, so afraid
[02:07.11] Hide behind that baby face
[02:10.36] Do-do-do, do-do-do
[02:18.88] You can drive all night
[02:23.06] Looking for the answers in the pouring rain
[02:27.39] You wanna find peace of mind
[02:32.27] Looking for the answer
[02:43.35] Funny how it seems like yesterday
[02:47.08] As I recall you were looking out of place
[02:52.14] Gathered up your things and slipped away
[02:55.52] No time at all, I followed you into the hall
[03:00.92] Cigarette daydream
[03:06.28] You were only 17
[03:09.57] So sweet with a mean streak
[03:14.54] Nearly brought me to my knees
